      <div class="about-text">
        <p>
          Hey!! My name is Mehak. I’m the once who’s always had a camera in hand, quietly catching the moments that everyone else forgets. <br><br>

A little bit about me, I’ve always loved the real parts of life. I’m a huge empath, so you’ll definitely see me heavily blinking during a doli. When I’m not capturing emotions, I’m studying them. I LOVE spending time with my family, friends, and especially my dog, Bruno. One of my favourite things in the world is travelling!!<br><br>



For me, it's all about intention. My intention is to preserve your most special moments. I’m drawn to the in-betweens: the laughter that happens between poses, the glances that say more than words, and the kind of memories that feel like you’ve travelled back in time when you look back at them.
<br><br>

What started as a simple love for documentation, turned into a passion for storytelling and curation. I focus on the candid, the raw, and the beautifully unscripted parts of your day. With carefully chosen music and thoughtful editing, I strive to transform your memories into something that truly feels alive. <br><br>


My goal is simple: to preserve emotions and feelings, so you can stay fully immersed in the moment.

<br><br><br><br>

          Your favorite third wheel,
        </p>
        <h3>Mehak Sekhon</h3>
      </div>
    </section>

